# Spineseeker Centipede's delirium needs four types (CR 207.2c): Faithless Looting (sorcery), an Island (land) and Lightning Bolt (instant) are only three,
# so it stays a 2/1 without vigilance. Its enter trigger still searches: the Mountain goes to the hand.


[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Faithless Looting
Island
Lightning Bolt
Spineseeker Centipede
Forest
Island
Mountain
Tolarian Academy
Island x9

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Faithless Looting.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Island; Lightning Bolt)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Spineseeker Centipede.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Search(Mountain)
? Bot1.Revealed = Mountain

[Expect]
Bot1.Hand = Forest; Mountain
Bot1.Battlefield.Spineseeker Centipede.Power = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Spineseeker Centipede.Toughness = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Spineseeker Centipede.Keywords = (absent)
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 3
